### URL shortener API contract (from the worked example in the guide).

### Create a short URL
POST https://s.io/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/a/very/long/path",
  "custom_alias": "my-link"
}

### Response
# {
#   "short_url": "https://s.io/my-link",
#   "code": "my-link"
# }

### Redirect (permanent, edge-cacheable)
GET https://s.io/my-link

### Response
# HTTP/1.1 301 Moved Permanently
# Location: https://example.com/a/very/long/path
# Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000

### Click analytics for a code
GET https://s.io/api/v1/stats/my-link

### Response
# {
#   "clicks": 12345,
#   "unique_visitors": 8900
# }
